    <description><![CDATA[
      <h2>What's New in 1.37</h2>
      <p>Changes since 1.36:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>8282930</code> Reset input state on app switch</li>
<li><code>20ed1ca</code> chmod +x build_dmg.sh</li>
<li><code>5098939</code> Add 'ViType-core/' from commit '9d5b8b965242d320fac846214e1cde784584b108'</li>
