<li><code>dcde593</code> Added a free_tone_placement config that bypasses cluster validation when enabled</li>
<li><code>37188b2</code> Vowel cluster validation</li>
<li><code>ef7607f</code> Handle pre-toned uo compounds</li>
<li><code>e69befc</code> Update doc</li>
<li><code>6285513</code> Fix uou compound tone placement</li>
<li><code>83ee090</code> Fix uo compounds with horned u</li>
<li><code>64cd0bc</code> Fix dd transform to avoid mid-word conversions</li>
<li><code>05d09d7</code> Fix backspace raw buffer sync</li>
<li><code>39ec803</code> Unify Telex and VNI transforms</li>
<li><code>4e8c483</code> Unify input method</li>
<li><code>cc4d374</code> Fix uoi compound leading horn</li>
<li><code>d580e4d</code> Add tests for uoi compound</li>
<li><code>0ef2059</code> Fix uoi horn transforms</li>
<li><code>501ac18</code> Allow circumflex override after w transform</li>
<li><code>86ee189</code> Lock transforms after escape until boundary</li>
<li><code>64b8e20</code> Refactor IME engine and split C FFI</li>
<li><code>afe9035</code> Map tests from Telex to VNI</li>
<li><code>4a689e5</code> Fix ưo consonant auto-fix</li>
<li><code>88d5523</code> Support modern tone placement</li>
<li><code>f03d795</code> Update agent files</li>
<li><code>e55983b</code> Fix: skip redundant rewrite when entering foreign mode</li>
<li><code>2102212</code> Update agent files</li>
<li><code>550f6eb</code> Keep 3-word history across boundaries</li>
<li><code>cf97998</code> Add license</li>
<li><code>fbaacc7</code> Support VNI</li>
<li><code>de2df9f</code> Support Composite Unicode</li>
<li><code>cb399eb</code> Generalize two-vowel tone placement with final consonant</li>
<li><code>2cdd749</code> u as slide</li>
<li><code>29a4eee</code> Initial commit</li>
</ul>
    ]]></description>
